WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.785
A strong advanced SQL solution includes reasoning
Sequenced is still

00:00:05.811 --> 00:00:11.772
one row per admission Intervals is one row per
admission that has a previous

00:00:11.799 --> 00:00:17.586
encounter The final output keeps that
repeat-admission grain while adding a name

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:23.194
and classification Being able to explain these
stages is more important

00:00:23.221 --> 00:00:25.207
than memorizing the exact query
